OL,3,GNEWSATeens shortlisted for outstanding
OL,4,Acitizen award
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been shortlisted for
OL,7,Fan award for their work in raising
OL,8,Fawareness about knife crime and mental
OL,9,Fhealth.
OL,11,FSienna Ahir, 17, a former Wolverhampton
OL,12,FYouth MP and anti-youth violence
OL,13,Factivist, has been praised for founding
OL,14,FDaggers Down, a youth-led safety
OL,15,Fcampaign which has seen 12 publicly
OL,16,Faccessible bleed control kits installed
OL,17,Facross the region.
OL,19,FEighteen-year-old Reice James has also
OL,20,Fbeen commended for his volunteering and
OL,21,Fcampaigns to promote men's mental
OL,22,Fhealth.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
