OL,3,GNEWSATeens shortlisted for outstanding
OL,4,Acitizen award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are both in the running to win the
OL,7,FWest Midlands Police and Crime
OL,8,FCommissioner's (PCC) Outstanding Young
OL,9,FCitizen Award, with the final winner to
OL,10,Fbe announced on 28 September at the
OL,11,FCoventry Boys and Girls Club.
